WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:42.840
Be it the previous life or the current,
just live to the fullest.

01:44.240 --> 01:46.120
Never compromise yourself

01:46.200 --> 01:48.240
to become someone else
just to please others,

01:50.200 --> 01:53.480
including me.

02:05.240 --> 02:12.080
RETURN OF THE CLOUDS

02:22.880 --> 02:24.080
Ms. Jiuyue.

02:24.160 --> 02:25.680
Magistrate Xue is recovering well.

02:26.160 --> 02:27.080
I left the prescription.

02:27.160 --> 02:28.640
After some time,

02:29.200 --> 02:30.720
Magistrate Xue will fully recover.

02:30.800 --> 02:34.040
You've refused to see me during this time.

02:35.200 --> 02:38.320
I finally get a chance to thank you today.

02:38.400 --> 02:39.480
There's no need.

02:40.400 --> 02:43.640
Xiao Heng has repaid this favor for you.

02:43.720 --> 02:46.960
If you need my help in the future,

02:47.640 --> 02:48.880
I will surely do my best.

02:50.040 --> 02:51.560
If you really want to help me,

02:52.360 --> 02:53.200
you should

02:54.160 --> 02:55.720
cherish the person you have now.

03:11.760 --> 03:13.120
Where's the bell I gave you?

03:13.200 --> 03:14.320
Wen Ji is keeping it.

03:14.880 --> 03:16.360
That's something I gave you.

03:16.440 --> 03:17.880
You need to keep it yourself.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.800
Why would I keep a lady's accessory?

03:19.880 --> 03:21.160
I must not be in my right mind.

03:21.960 --> 03:23.680
Why on earth did I give it to you?

03:42.480 --> 03:46.040
Jiuyue, tell me honestly.

03:46.120 --> 03:47.440
Do you

03:48.080 --> 03:49.400
love Duke Su?

03:51.200 --> 03:55.280
Why did you suddenly say that, my brother?

03:56.920 --> 03:59.160
I heard you gave him the bell.

03:59.640 --> 04:01.520
That was given to you by Mother.

04:01.600 --> 04:03.640
She asked you
to give it to the person you love.

04:05.560 --> 04:06.920
If you want,

04:07.560 --> 04:09.920
I can propose marriage
to the Emperor of Great Yan.

04:17.640 --> 04:18.480
My brother…

04:20.399 --> 04:22.120
some things can't be forced.

04:24.080 --> 04:25.560
If he really likes me,

04:27.720 --> 04:30.040
he won't wait for you to propose it.

04:43.640 --> 04:45.360
Quick! Clean the place!

04:45.440 --> 04:46.400
Yes, Mrs. Shen.

04:47.160 --> 04:48.960
Be careful with the vase. It's an antique.

04:49.040 --> 04:49.960
Be careful!

04:50.520 --> 04:53.040
Seriously. Work quickly.

04:53.120 --> 04:54.840
- Yes, Mrs, Shen.
- Hurry!

04:54.920 --> 04:57.040
Mrs. Shen, this is
the guest list for tonight.

05:00.640 --> 05:01.480
BANQUET GUEST LIST

05:01.560 --> 05:06.120
SCHOOL OF INTEGRITY: JIANG LI, LIU XU
IMPERIAL ACADEMY: JIANG JINGRUI, ZHAO QI

05:13.040 --> 05:14.200
I don't agree for her to come.

05:16.000 --> 05:18.640
Her Highness will be able
to come out soon.

05:18.720 --> 05:20.360
I have a bad feeling about this.

05:21.160 --> 05:24.320
Don't let Jiang Li come here.
You can't make another mistake.

05:26.360 --> 05:28.920
Sure. I won't let her come here.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.040
You must be thirsty now.

05:30.520 --> 05:32.080
I'll get you a cup of water.

05:34.720 --> 05:36.600
You finally know how to be filial to me.

05:39.240 --> 05:41.920
DELAYED FAREWELL

05:59.440 --> 06:00.280
Mother.

06:02.120 --> 06:03.520
You can go and do your work.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.080
Yurong, where's Mother?

06:40.160 --> 06:41.680
Why can't I find her anywhere?

06:41.760 --> 06:43.400
Mother was busy the whole day

06:43.480 --> 06:44.360
and caught a cold.

06:44.840 --> 06:47.040
I gave her some medicine
and she's asleep now.

06:47.600 --> 06:48.680
I'll go and check on her.

06:49.840 --> 06:51.960
Don't disturb her. She is fast asleep.

06:52.040 --> 06:54.680
Get changed
and welcome the guests with me.

06:57.120 --> 06:58.120
I'll go dress up then.

07:05.320 --> 07:12.320
SHEN RESIDENCE

07:21.760 --> 07:22.760
Greetings, Mr. Shen.

07:26.680 --> 07:28.320
- Greetings, Mr. Shen.
- Greetings, Mr. Shen.

07:41.040 --> 07:42.840
SHEN RESIDENCE

07:48.440 --> 07:49.280
Mr. Shen.

07:57.080 --> 07:57.960
Please come in.

08:01.480 --> 08:05.320
SHEN RESIDENCE

08:15.280 --> 08:16.560
All right, here.

08:16.640 --> 08:17.560
Here, come on.

08:17.640 --> 08:18.480
- Here.
- Don't be shy.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.480
- Here.
- Here.

08:22.560 --> 08:25.160
Mr. Shen, leading the alliance meeting
between the two nations

08:25.240 --> 08:26.720
has made His Majesty very happy.

08:26.800 --> 08:29.120
Mr. Shen, you have a bright future ahead.

08:34.200 --> 08:35.440
You'll know when the time comes.

08:36.480 --> 08:39.000
Mr. Shen, you're highly favored
by His Majesty now.

08:39.080 --> 08:41.720
I hope you will help me
in the future, Mr. Shen.

08:45.160 --> 08:46.760
Mr. Shen, a toast to you.

08:49.200 --> 08:50.800
- Here.
- Here.

08:50.880 --> 08:51.960
Here's a toast to you.

08:52.040 --> 08:53.040
Come on. Let's drink.

08:55.560 --> 08:56.600
A toast to you too.

08:56.680 --> 08:57.520
Come on.

08:58.440 --> 08:59.480
That's so nice of you.

09:00.320 --> 09:01.680
Here, the loser will drink.

09:01.760 --> 09:03.720
- You said it.
- Fine. I'll drink.

09:12.760 --> 09:14.360
- Why did I lose again?
- Drink.

09:14.440 --> 09:15.440
Here.

09:19.240 --> 09:20.320
The moon is pretty tonight.

09:20.400 --> 09:21.680
Outstanding.

09:24.760 --> 09:25.960
Indeed.

09:28.160 --> 09:30.560
Here. Let me offer you another toast.

10:13.040 --> 10:15.240
So Li, starting today,

10:15.880 --> 10:17.760
you don't have to fear anyone anymore.

10:39.240 --> 10:41.200
- Who are you? Go away!
- Dear!

10:41.280 --> 10:42.320
- Let me go!
- Dear!

10:43.280 --> 10:44.120
Dear!

10:53.640 --> 10:57.640
Mr. Shen, when will you stop following me?

11:04.000 --> 11:06.080
Ms. Jiang Li, it's your first time here,

11:06.680 --> 11:08.440
but you're quite familiar with this place.

11:10.080 --> 11:13.240
If you want to enter,
I can open the door for you.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.400
Only a good place

11:16.000 --> 11:17.800
makes people want to visit again.

11:18.760 --> 11:22.680
Do you think I'd want
to go into that place?

11:28.240 --> 11:29.400
You're not pretending anymore?

11:36.920 --> 11:39.800
I tried convincing myself to believe

11:39.880 --> 11:40.960
that you are Jiang Li.

11:42.240 --> 11:44.560
You can keep putting on an act
and pretending.

11:46.080 --> 11:47.480
I will also keep believing you.

11:49.160 --> 11:51.840
There's no need for that now.

11:52.480 --> 11:53.600
You are so honest.

11:54.960 --> 11:57.320
Aren't you afraid
that I'd expose your identity?

11:57.400 --> 11:59.280
You've long known my identity.

12:00.640 --> 12:02.000
If you want to,

12:02.760 --> 12:04.560
you can expose me anytime.

12:05.640 --> 12:08.400
But you didn't. Why?

12:12.560 --> 12:14.160
Your mother

12:15.000 --> 12:16.360
set up my affair, right?

12:18.320 --> 12:19.600
You killed me

12:20.320 --> 12:22.640
because your mother threatened you
that she'd commit suicide?

12:24.280 --> 12:25.520
I had no choice.

12:26.080 --> 12:28.360
You always like putting all the blame

12:28.880 --> 12:30.320
on other people.

12:31.280 --> 12:32.960
- Xue Li.
- Shen Yurong.

12:33.040 --> 12:34.880
You are used

12:34.960 --> 12:36.760
to being the clean and honest scholar.

12:37.720 --> 12:40.280
You had no choice in everything you did.
You did nothing wrong.

12:40.360 --> 12:43.240
You are pitiful. Even you believe that.

12:43.800 --> 12:45.640
So when you protected me
from the sword that day

12:46.360 --> 12:48.400
and said you love me,

12:48.880 --> 12:50.680
it just made me feel disgusted.

12:53.200 --> 12:55.800
Since you could mention your love,

12:56.440 --> 12:58.080
why couldn't you express your guilt?

12:59.400 --> 13:01.760
You protected my identity
in the main hall.

13:02.360 --> 13:05.120
You risked your life to save me
before a sword.

13:05.200 --> 13:07.160
You're still salvageable now.

13:10.960 --> 13:13.960
Xue Li, I've let you down.

13:15.040 --> 13:17.760
Both of us should take another path.

13:22.280 --> 13:23.440
What path?

13:28.040 --> 13:31.160
Go to the main hall
and tell His Majesty everything.

13:32.160 --> 13:33.680
Face His Majesty yourself

13:33.760 --> 13:35.120
and tell him everything

13:35.200 --> 13:38.000
you and Wanning did to the Xue family.

13:39.360 --> 13:41.360
This is the only way
for you to atone for your sins.

13:41.960 --> 13:43.400
I know you still have a conscience.

13:43.480 --> 13:45.760
This is the last chance I'm giving you.

13:45.840 --> 13:47.920
You are being so honest with me

13:50.040 --> 13:51.840
only because you want me
to confess my crimes?

13:51.920 --> 13:53.760
This is what you are supposed to do.

13:53.840 --> 13:56.400
Shen Yurong, you're a well-educated man.

13:56.480 --> 13:59.120
You should know
that it's never too late to turn back.

14:00.760 --> 14:05.520
Xue Li, I've already killed you

14:06.920 --> 14:08.880
and it has made me regret it forever.

14:08.960 --> 14:13.720
If my mother and sister
die because of me too,

14:14.880 --> 14:16.360
I can never atone for my sins.

14:16.840 --> 14:20.080
You can do anything you want with me,

14:20.160 --> 14:21.280
but I must

14:23.880 --> 14:25.000
protect the Shen family.

14:34.520 --> 14:38.800
So in your opinion,

14:39.920 --> 14:41.920
the crimes of your mother and your sister

14:42.880 --> 14:44.080
do not need to be atoned

14:44.160 --> 14:47.360
and my innocence and grievance

14:49.040 --> 14:50.560
do not need to be compensated.

14:51.720 --> 14:52.840
Right?

14:54.240 --> 14:55.120
I'm sorry.

14:55.960 --> 14:56.960
Fine.

14:57.560 --> 15:01.400
Shen Yurong, you don't want
to choose this path.

15:02.760 --> 15:04.960
I'm wrong about you again.

15:06.120 --> 15:07.400
You can keep being obsessed.

15:07.920 --> 15:11.240
Just wait until the day

15:11.320 --> 15:14.760
I make you and Wanning
pay for what you've done.

15:14.840 --> 15:16.600
You will never win against Wanning.

15:16.680 --> 15:18.040
Prince Cheng supports her.

15:19.440 --> 15:20.440
I'm not like you.

15:20.520 --> 15:22.240
You're a weak coward!

15:22.320 --> 15:24.040
I'm reminding you.

15:24.120 --> 15:25.040
That's not necessary.

15:25.600 --> 15:27.000
Xue Li, listen to me.

15:27.080 --> 15:29.120
Let go, Shen Yurong!

15:29.200 --> 15:30.240
Let go!

15:30.320 --> 15:31.560
Let go of me!

15:32.360 --> 15:33.680
Let go of me, Shen Yurong!

15:55.200 --> 15:56.360
Are you all right?

15:57.840 --> 15:58.760
I'm fine.

15:58.840 --> 16:01.760
You've been away for a long time,
so I came to find you since I was worried.

16:02.480 --> 16:03.920
I didn't expect him to dare to…

16:09.960 --> 16:12.040
He's still breathing. He should be fine.

16:12.680 --> 16:13.840
I'll go and find a physician.

16:14.480 --> 16:15.320
Shijie,

16:16.920 --> 16:18.160
stay out of this.

16:18.800 --> 16:19.640
I'll deal with it.

16:21.200 --> 16:22.040
Why?

16:22.680 --> 16:24.920
I saw him act with bad intentions
towards you just now.

16:25.000 --> 16:26.640
He did act with bad intentions towards me.

16:27.280 --> 16:28.960
That was why I knocked him out.

16:29.040 --> 16:30.360
I was the one who did that.

16:30.440 --> 16:34.600
Shen Yurong has
Eldest Princess Wanning's support.

16:36.320 --> 16:39.680
If Wanning holds a grudge
against you because of this,

16:40.640 --> 16:43.720
you and the Ye family
will face huge trouble.

16:44.680 --> 16:48.240
Listen to me.
Wanning and I already have a beef.

16:48.920 --> 16:49.960
This won't make a difference.

16:50.040 --> 16:53.080
But how can I let you
take the blame for me?

16:53.640 --> 16:57.200
To be honest, I was about to hit him.

16:58.200 --> 17:00.160
You just did what I wanted.

17:00.240 --> 17:03.760
Moreover, if you are not involved in this,

17:03.840 --> 17:05.920
you'll be able to help me
from behind better.

17:06.000 --> 17:08.000
But I can openly help you.

17:08.079 --> 17:09.880
This is my personal grievance.

17:09.960 --> 17:11.000
I know.

17:11.079 --> 17:12.000
You don't know.

17:13.880 --> 17:15.359
Have you been falsely accused?

17:18.079 --> 17:19.720
Has your reputation been sullied?

17:22.160 --> 17:23.800
Have you been locked up in a woodshed?

17:25.839 --> 17:27.480
Have you been buried alive?

17:30.080 --> 17:31.480
Do you also know

17:33.320 --> 17:36.160
how many people died because of this?

17:36.800 --> 17:37.800
Xue Fangfei.

17:40.120 --> 17:42.360
I truly want to help you.

17:44.120 --> 17:45.600
Since you know everything,

17:47.720 --> 17:51.360
listen to me and leave.

17:53.280 --> 17:54.920
Otherwise, you'll be causing me trouble.

18:00.760 --> 18:03.600
I'm begging you, Ye Shijie.

18:29.680 --> 18:30.520
Mother.

18:31.320 --> 18:32.560
You can go and do your work.

18:37.240 --> 18:38.200
Oh, no.

18:39.000 --> 18:41.000
Yurong!

18:41.080 --> 18:41.920
Here.

18:42.000 --> 18:44.640
Yurong, where are you?

18:49.360 --> 18:52.960
Yurong! Where are you?

18:53.040 --> 18:54.640
Don't scare me!

18:56.040 --> 18:57.320
What happened?

18:57.400 --> 18:58.400
I don't know.

18:59.160 --> 19:01.760
- Yurong! Where are you?
- What's going on? What should we do?

19:01.840 --> 19:02.840
- Mother.
- Let's take a look.

19:02.920 --> 19:04.520
- Let's go.
- Let's take a look.

19:04.600 --> 19:05.520
- Let's go.
- Mother!

19:20.400 --> 19:21.240
Yurong!

19:23.080 --> 19:24.120
Yurong!

19:29.120 --> 19:30.520
- Mother.
- What's wrong?

19:41.520 --> 19:43.480
Mr. Shen wanted to defile me.

19:44.280 --> 19:45.400
- What?
- That's…

19:51.680 --> 19:55.400
Yurong! Let go of my son!

19:55.480 --> 19:57.400
Return my son to me!

19:57.480 --> 19:59.600
Yurong, come back! Yurong!

19:59.680 --> 20:03.240
Return my son to me! Let him go!

20:03.800 --> 20:05.320
Don't go!

20:05.400 --> 20:06.240
Capture her!

20:06.320 --> 20:08.280
She injured my son!

20:08.360 --> 20:09.720
- Mother.
- What are you doing?

20:09.800 --> 20:11.120
Shen Yurong disrespected Jiang Li first.

20:11.200 --> 20:13.040
He has been sent
to the Court of Judicial Review.

20:13.120 --> 20:14.760
If you keep this unreasonable act up,

20:14.840 --> 20:16.320
he will never return.

20:19.800 --> 20:21.080
You…

20:21.160 --> 20:22.400
You…

20:23.880 --> 20:26.760
Mother!

20:27.760 --> 20:28.880
Mother!

20:28.960 --> 20:31.000
Mother, wake up! Mother!

20:32.040 --> 20:32.880
Mother!

20:32.960 --> 20:34.360
SHEN RESIDENCE

20:34.440 --> 20:36.320
Mother, wake up!

20:37.640 --> 20:38.760
Mother.

20:40.400 --> 20:42.280
Mother, wake up!

20:42.360 --> 20:43.320
What's wrong, Mrs. Shen?

20:43.400 --> 20:46.000
- Are you all right?
- Mother, are you all right?

20:47.120 --> 20:49.480
- Mrs. Shen.
- Mrs. Shen.

20:50.480 --> 20:52.640
JIANG RESIDENCE

21:00.200 --> 21:02.960
Li'er, you must be shocked.

21:06.480 --> 21:07.480
Grandmother,

21:07.560 --> 21:11.480
are ugly rumors being spread out there?

21:12.880 --> 21:14.480
Will it affect the Jiang family?

21:14.560 --> 21:17.080
It's the child of the Jiang family
who was mistreated.

21:17.720 --> 21:20.840
After your father knew about this,
he rushed back to the capital overnight.

21:21.800 --> 21:24.160
Just rest and don't think about anything.

21:24.240 --> 21:25.440
Leave it to your family.

21:26.120 --> 21:28.320
We must not let you just suffer
this great grievance.

21:28.400 --> 21:30.360
Come on, get some rest.

21:44.760 --> 21:46.240
How do you plan to deal with this?

21:47.000 --> 21:49.040
Li'er is the Jiang family's
eldest legitimate daughter.

21:49.520 --> 21:51.120
Let's not talk about how the Jiang family

21:51.200 --> 21:53.160
is going to seek justice for her first.

21:53.240 --> 21:54.320
Let's just talk about

21:55.560 --> 21:57.680
the Shen family daring
to do this to the Jiang family.

21:57.760 --> 21:59.360
This incident

21:59.440 --> 22:01.760
is already known
to everyone in the capital.

22:01.840 --> 22:03.720
You've guarded your reputation
your whole life,

22:04.560 --> 22:05.440
but your reputation

22:06.040 --> 22:07.960
is tarnished by the Shen family now.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.560
Can you really let this go?

22:11.400 --> 22:14.200
Li'er was abandoned
at Zhennv Hall since she was little.

22:14.280 --> 22:18.360
You haven't fulfilled your responsibility
as a father all these years.

22:19.440 --> 22:22.280
And since she came back last year,
terrible things kept happening.

22:23.720 --> 22:25.400
And you showed
little consideration for her.

22:26.320 --> 22:30.800
This time, you must think carefully.

22:31.360 --> 22:32.720
Mother, you are right.

22:34.320 --> 22:37.120
I was too suspicious back then.

22:37.200 --> 22:40.240
I didn't know I hurt my relationship
with my daughter.

22:40.320 --> 22:43.880
This time, I must
fulfill my responsibility as a father

22:43.960 --> 22:46.200
and seek justice for my daughter.

22:48.360 --> 22:51.960
Set up the table! I will write
a complaint for Li'er personally.

23:00.880 --> 23:04.360
It has been a while.
You look quite haggard.

23:05.240 --> 23:06.800
Thanks to you, Your Majesty,

23:07.880 --> 23:08.960
I have really

23:09.640 --> 23:10.560
learned a lot.

23:10.640 --> 23:12.560
It's great
that you understand my intentions.

23:13.440 --> 23:14.960
You're not grounded starting today.

23:15.040 --> 23:18.040
Remember not to be so willful
in the future.

23:20.720 --> 23:23.000
Speaking of which,
something happened recently.

23:23.080 --> 23:24.360
I was so busy

23:24.440 --> 23:25.840
that I neglected you.

23:25.920 --> 23:29.080
What troubles you, Your Majesty?

23:29.160 --> 23:30.760
the Emperor of Great Zhao came here

23:30.840 --> 23:32.200
to bring his long-lost sister home.

23:32.680 --> 23:34.280
However, coincidentally,

23:34.360 --> 23:35.880
his sister encountered an assassin.

23:35.960 --> 23:36.880
That's outrageous.

23:38.240 --> 23:39.240
Was the assassin captured?

23:40.080 --> 23:41.000
He escaped.

23:41.080 --> 23:42.520
So aggressive.

23:42.600 --> 23:44.720
An assassin entered
and left the capital as he wished.

23:45.520 --> 23:46.800
So of course, I got furious.

23:46.880 --> 23:50.240
It's bad when the Emperor gets angry.

23:50.320 --> 23:53.120
So I abolished the Palace Security Office
that hid the assassin.

23:53.200 --> 23:54.600
The Palace Security Office?

23:54.680 --> 23:56.920
Yes. I'm curious as well.

23:57.000 --> 23:59.040
How could the Great Yan's
Palace Security Office

23:59.720 --> 24:01.520
pledged its loyalty
to someone else in secret?

24:02.360 --> 24:03.720
Wanning, help me think about this.

24:04.320 --> 24:06.120
Is there someone

24:06.200 --> 24:09.000
who doesn't want a friendly relationship
between Great Zhao and us?

24:15.200 --> 24:17.080
Our brother achieved
military merits up north,

24:17.560 --> 24:19.280
and Your Majesty
is friendly with Great Zhao.

24:19.760 --> 24:22.840
Stability in the north and south
is a blessing for Great Yan.

24:22.920 --> 24:24.480
Why would anyone try to destroy this?

24:25.040 --> 24:25.920
You are right.

24:26.880 --> 24:29.120
It is extremely foolish

24:29.200 --> 24:30.800
for someone to cause trouble now.

24:30.880 --> 24:34.920
The alliance ceremony is over.
Everything is set in stone.

24:35.000 --> 24:38.080
It's a shame
you weren't present at the banquet

24:38.160 --> 24:40.320
and missed the Jiang-Shen performance.

24:40.960 --> 24:42.040
You said

24:42.120 --> 24:44.280
Ms. Jiang Li is Shen Yurong's late wife.

24:44.760 --> 24:47.760
Now that I think about it,
it's lamentable.

24:47.840 --> 24:49.560
Since Your Majesty said that,

24:50.840 --> 24:52.240
how regrettable for me.

24:52.760 --> 24:54.080
It's quite regretful indeed.

24:54.160 --> 24:56.760
Shen Yurong's awaiting his sentence
at the Court of Judicial Review.

24:57.360 --> 25:00.360
His crime is attempted sexual assault
on Ms. Jiang Li.

25:00.920 --> 25:03.800
The performance at the banquet
became their last one.

25:04.360 --> 25:07.760
Mr. Shen dared to do something so filthy?

25:07.840 --> 25:10.640
Yes. I'm quite surprised as well.

25:11.200 --> 25:12.240
It's late.

25:13.480 --> 25:15.080
You should go back to rest.

25:15.960 --> 25:17.080
Thank you, Your Majesty.

25:38.840 --> 25:40.920
- Let's go to the Court of Judicial Review.
- Yes.

25:41.520 --> 25:43.120
COURT OF JUDICIAL REVIEW

25:52.360 --> 25:53.240
Shen Yurong,

25:54.120 --> 25:56.640
is this what you mean
by having a clear conscience?

25:58.640 --> 26:02.760
To the point of wanting
to be intimate with her?

26:04.200 --> 26:06.080
Are you not afraid to die at all?

26:06.960 --> 26:09.320
Raise your head.

26:15.560 --> 26:16.600
Why are you laughing?

26:17.080 --> 26:17.920
Kill me.

26:18.400 --> 26:19.240
What do you mean?

26:19.720 --> 26:22.680
You always like
to look down at me from above like this.

26:23.440 --> 26:27.520
You knew I was hiding evil and wickedness
behind my clean and honest facade,

26:27.600 --> 26:30.400
yet you still wanted to control me.

26:31.280 --> 26:34.360
I'm sick of it now.
Aren't you tired as well, Your Highness?

26:34.840 --> 26:38.840
I killed my wife
for my mother's and my sister's sake.

26:39.760 --> 26:40.760
To gain power,

26:41.360 --> 26:43.760
I tainted the reputation
I obtained from studying hard.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.920
I deserve to die.

26:49.640 --> 26:51.280
Are you blaming me again?

26:51.360 --> 26:54.480
I'm not blaming Your Highness.
I'm not blaming anyone.

26:56.040 --> 26:58.680
I just hope Your Highness can live well

26:58.760 --> 27:00.680
and spare my mother and my sister.

27:00.760 --> 27:04.200
As for myself,
if Your Highness doesn't kill me,

27:04.280 --> 27:06.040
you may wait until I'm sentenced.

27:06.760 --> 27:08.000
Be it banishment,

27:08.600 --> 27:09.640
execution,

27:10.320 --> 27:11.680
or lifelong imprisonment.

27:13.440 --> 27:14.640
I'll accept it.

27:15.240 --> 27:16.720
What kind of crazy talk is this?

27:18.000 --> 27:19.280
Do you want me to pity you?

27:19.760 --> 27:20.880
To feel sorry for you?

27:21.360 --> 27:22.640
To save you?

27:39.640 --> 27:41.320
Your Highness doesn't need to save me.

27:41.840 --> 27:45.960
You've toyed with me for so long.
I'm sure you are tired of me now.

27:55.680 --> 27:56.640
I'm not tired of you.

27:58.760 --> 27:59.880
Have you accepted your fate?

28:01.360 --> 28:04.440
Shen Yurong, in this world,

28:05.520 --> 28:08.880
I'm the only one
who can decide how you die.

28:09.760 --> 28:11.080
The Imperial Court is nothing.

28:12.160 --> 28:15.000
Your life is in my hands.

28:17.240 --> 28:18.160
What do you want to do?

28:22.480 --> 28:23.560
Naturally…

28:27.040 --> 28:28.160
I'm going to save you.

28:43.000 --> 28:44.720
You're still not resting so late at night?

28:52.760 --> 28:54.160
Did you fly back from Great Zhao?

28:58.000 --> 28:59.320
You came to find me at this time.

28:59.800 --> 29:01.280
Aren't you afraid someone might see you?

29:01.960 --> 29:02.800
Tea.

29:14.040 --> 29:15.080
What is your next step?

29:16.640 --> 29:18.280
Do you remember when I asked you

29:19.360 --> 29:21.280
where in the capital

29:21.360 --> 29:23.360
is Shen Yurong and the Eldest Princess?

29:24.280 --> 29:27.120
I thought Shen Yurong would repent,

29:27.200 --> 29:29.600
but I didn't expect him to insist
on going down the wrong path.

29:30.680 --> 29:31.600
Right now,

29:32.760 --> 29:36.360
I want to use Shen Yurong
as my pawn to find that location.

29:37.160 --> 29:39.040
I want to expose their filthy relationship

29:39.120 --> 29:40.640
to the public.

29:43.720 --> 29:47.960
Do you think Wanning
will save Shen Yurong?

29:49.360 --> 29:51.840
If she doesn't save him, she will lose.

29:55.840 --> 29:57.920
An arrogant person like Princess Wanning

29:58.600 --> 29:59.920
will surely fall into this trap.

30:03.120 --> 30:05.000
Do you think you are amazing?

30:09.040 --> 30:10.080
What's with you?

30:10.160 --> 30:12.000
Is sacrificing both your reputation

30:12.080 --> 30:13.520
and his future

30:14.840 --> 30:16.080
a win for you?

30:16.920 --> 30:17.760
Xiao Heng,

30:19.680 --> 30:21.720
I'm not as shallow as you imagined.

30:22.600 --> 30:24.480
I wanted to give Shen Yurong
another way out.

30:25.040 --> 30:26.680
At the place where I was set up,

30:26.760 --> 30:29.240
I wanted to see
if his conscience still existed

30:29.320 --> 30:30.760
and if he'd confess to his crimes.

30:31.320 --> 30:34.000
I never expected him
to still refuse me in the end.

30:34.720 --> 30:36.760
At that moment,
I figured I was wasting my energy

30:36.840 --> 30:37.800
and prepared to give up,

30:37.880 --> 30:39.360
but he wouldn't let me go,

30:39.440 --> 30:40.920
so it made Ye Shijie misunderstand

30:41.000 --> 30:42.360
and knock him out.

30:43.680 --> 30:45.080
The Ye family is Jiang Li's family

30:45.640 --> 30:46.520
and my family too.

30:48.200 --> 30:50.640
I can't drag them down

30:50.720 --> 30:52.200
because of me.

30:52.920 --> 30:56.600
So I must admit
to the crime of hitting him.

30:56.680 --> 30:58.800
So he did attempt to disrespect you.

30:58.880 --> 31:00.800
Otherwise, you'd be
the one in prison today!

31:02.600 --> 31:03.440
Yes.

31:03.520 --> 31:06.640
You promised me twice not to get
yourself involved in the scheme.

31:08.520 --> 31:10.960
This is the second time
you have broken your promise.

31:12.640 --> 31:14.840
It was not my intention this time.

31:14.920 --> 31:16.480
I was just forced by the circumstances.

31:19.040 --> 31:19.960
Li,

31:21.760 --> 31:24.480
what should I do with you?

31:26.120 --> 31:27.080
No matter what,

31:29.440 --> 31:31.080
I need to apologize to you.

31:32.760 --> 31:34.160
You once told me

31:35.200 --> 31:38.000
our methods will achieve the same result.

31:39.000 --> 31:42.760
I know you must juggle
your big responsibility to the nation,

31:43.600 --> 31:45.360
as well as my safety.

31:46.560 --> 31:50.160
Right now, I'm willing
to walk into this scheme of yours.

31:51.640 --> 31:55.720
I'm not a liability. I want to help you.

32:14.040 --> 32:16.640
My lady, Wen Ji insisted
on having me tell you

32:16.720 --> 32:18.480
that once Duke Su knew
what happened to you,

32:18.560 --> 32:19.920
he rushed here from the border

32:20.000 --> 32:22.160
and left the Great Zhao delegation behind.

32:24.120 --> 32:25.000
I know.

32:26.720 --> 32:30.120
He was still wearing
the same outfit he wore when he left.

32:43.120 --> 32:45.840
Your Highness, Prince Cheng
asked me to send a message.

32:45.920 --> 32:48.080
Shen Yurong's reputation is ruined now.

32:48.640 --> 32:50.280
If you save him,

32:50.360 --> 32:51.720
you might dirty your hands.

32:52.360 --> 32:54.360
You should consider killing him soon

32:55.680 --> 32:57.920
and making it look like a suicide
out of guilt.

33:00.760 --> 33:04.080
Just a little hiccup and he's panicking.

33:05.520 --> 33:07.680
My brother is still so impatient.

33:08.240 --> 33:11.000
Tell him to just focus
on training his troops.

33:11.640 --> 33:15.200
I'll manage things in the Imperial Court.

33:17.680 --> 33:18.520
Yes.

33:23.480 --> 33:27.200
Xue Fangfei, it's time for me to meet you.

33:30.080 --> 33:31.760
How do you plan to deal with Shen Yurong?

33:31.840 --> 33:34.280
GOVERN PEOPLE, SERVE THE HEAVENS

33:34.360 --> 33:36.120
That depends on
what the Jiang family wants.

33:36.200 --> 33:37.640
The Jiang family won't forgive him.

33:37.720 --> 33:38.840
That suits me.

33:39.920 --> 33:42.280
I want to see how Wanning will react.

33:42.840 --> 33:44.720
Ms. Jiang Li is a capable person.

33:45.640 --> 33:47.080
Unfortunately, she is not a man.

33:47.720 --> 33:49.680
Otherwise, she can contribute greatly
to the Imperial Court.

33:49.760 --> 33:50.960
Has Your Majesty considered

33:51.760 --> 33:54.120
that she might be in danger
if she keeps going down this path?

33:54.720 --> 33:57.520
It was fine when you urged her
to approach Shen Yurong,

33:57.600 --> 34:00.320
but you even added fuel to the fire
with Eldest Princess afterward.

34:01.200 --> 34:02.080
Have you considered

34:03.040 --> 34:05.840
that she might not be able to handle
the Eldest Princess's counterattack?

34:05.920 --> 34:09.800
She's just a pawn.
Why are you getting so concerned?

34:14.040 --> 34:15.639
She stopped being a pawn a long time ago.

34:22.360 --> 34:23.199
Xiao Heng.

34:30.239 --> 34:31.480
Have you fallen for her?

34:31.560 --> 34:32.639
Yes.

34:32.719 --> 34:35.520
I warned you not to get too involved.

34:36.320 --> 34:38.360
Have you forgotten
the kind of path we are walking on?

34:38.920 --> 34:39.840
What if I say

34:40.360 --> 34:42.480
I must sacrifice her

34:42.560 --> 34:44.120
to achieve our ambition?

34:47.920 --> 34:52.080
Does Your Majesty still remember
your first Imperial Court session?

34:55.280 --> 34:57.320
- Why isn't His Majesty here yet?
- Yes.

34:58.160 --> 35:00.120
He doesn't attend
his first Imperial Court session.

35:00.200 --> 35:02.240
Can he become a good emperor?

35:05.360 --> 35:08.680
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

35:09.160 --> 35:10.600
Where are you, Your Majesty?

35:11.720 --> 35:13.000
- Your Majesty!
- He's not here.

35:13.080 --> 35:14.520
Let's go and look for him over there.

35:14.600 --> 35:15.440
Let's go.

35:15.520 --> 35:17.000
They are all looking for you.

35:17.080 --> 35:18.680
If I leave,

35:18.760 --> 35:20.560
this bird will die.

35:21.120 --> 35:22.840
It's your first Imperial Court session.

35:22.920 --> 35:25.480
If you are absent, they'll be distraught.

35:25.560 --> 35:27.560
Come on. Let me help you
put it back on the tree.

35:27.640 --> 35:28.480
I know.

35:29.040 --> 35:30.680
They are not sincerely loyal to me.

35:31.880 --> 35:34.360
And I can't navigate through
all the plotting and trickery.

35:34.880 --> 35:37.760
It's better to get someone
who's capable of that to do it.

35:40.320 --> 35:42.480
How do you know you can't do it
if you don't try?

35:42.560 --> 35:46.360
Tell me, what could Father
have liked about me?

35:46.440 --> 35:48.400
Perhaps the late emperor

35:48.480 --> 35:50.360
saw your sincerity

35:51.040 --> 35:52.800
and your love for every life in the world.

35:53.560 --> 35:55.800
If you can always remember this kindness

35:55.880 --> 35:57.400
and always be a good emperor,

35:57.480 --> 35:59.920
I believe the heavens
will bless a good emperor.

36:00.520 --> 36:01.440
And I

36:03.960 --> 36:05.480
will always be with you.

36:08.760 --> 36:12.040
That's not really a moment
I want to remember.

36:12.840 --> 36:14.680
I know Your Majesty
is under great pressure recently.

36:15.360 --> 36:18.320
Prince Cheng is looking on covetously
and Wanning is getting ready to strike.

36:21.120 --> 36:22.760
Your Majesty shouldn't panic

36:23.520 --> 36:25.120
and forget your initial intention.

36:26.080 --> 36:29.200
No matter what happens,
I'll always be by your side.

36:30.000 --> 36:31.720
As long as you are still a good emperor,

36:32.360 --> 36:36.240
the Xiao clan and I
would swear our loyalty to you.

36:38.720 --> 36:42.520
Protect your own pawn well.

36:50.560 --> 36:51.720
In a few days,

36:52.320 --> 36:54.320
the Court of Judicial Review
will try Shen Yurong.

36:54.880 --> 36:57.720
Are you sure you don't want me to admit
that I knocked him out?

36:57.800 --> 37:01.480
If the testimony changes,
it'll only cause doubts.

37:01.560 --> 37:02.640
The main thing in this case

37:02.720 --> 37:04.520
is not who knocked Shen Yurong out,

37:04.600 --> 37:06.920
but Shen Yurong's
disrespectful act towards me.

37:07.480 --> 37:09.920
But no matter how I think about it,
it was because I was too impulsive.

37:10.000 --> 37:11.160
You did it for my sake.

37:12.560 --> 37:13.480
You were helping me.

37:14.680 --> 37:16.760
I've long wanted to thank you.

37:16.840 --> 37:19.160
Yesterday, I asked
the Court of Judicial Review's Minister.

37:19.840 --> 37:22.600
He said there is evidence
and witnesses for this case.

37:23.240 --> 37:25.280
No matter how capable Shen Yurong is,

37:25.960 --> 37:27.560
he won't be able to silence everyone.

37:28.360 --> 37:30.320
Since he doesn't want
to become a good official,

37:30.920 --> 37:32.920
let his reputation be destroyed.

37:33.000 --> 37:34.320
Don't you think it's scary?

37:34.800 --> 37:36.480
I'm not Jiang Li

37:37.120 --> 37:38.640
and I'm not your cousin.

37:41.600 --> 37:43.800
I'm a woman with a tarnished reputation.

37:44.640 --> 37:46.480
I am Shen Yurong's dead wife.

37:47.080 --> 37:49.600
I lived on using Jiang Li's identity.

37:52.360 --> 37:54.760
Now, I even returned
to the Jiang family to stir up trouble.

37:56.600 --> 37:57.760
I don't think it's scary.

38:01.360 --> 38:02.440
No matter who you are,

38:03.440 --> 38:06.720
you helped me and the Ye family.

38:08.000 --> 38:10.640
What we've been through
during this time is real.

38:13.000 --> 38:16.960
And after I truly understood
what you went through,

38:18.680 --> 38:19.640
I realized

38:21.720 --> 38:23.960
that my knowledge of you
was so shallow in the past.

38:25.160 --> 38:30.560
So just do anything you want from now on.

38:37.640 --> 38:39.520
Are you not going to ask me
what I'm going to do?

38:42.320 --> 38:46.280
I just want to tell you
that no matter how far you go,

38:47.840 --> 38:49.720
I'll always be on your side.

38:58.040 --> 39:00.800
My lady, the Eldest Princess' Mansion
sent you an invitation.

39:10.920 --> 39:11.760
JIANG LI

39:11.840 --> 39:15.560
Is she planning something
with this invitation?

39:15.640 --> 39:17.920
During the trial of Xue Huaiyuan's case,

39:18.600 --> 39:21.200
the Eldest Princess
gave Li'er a hard time.

39:22.280 --> 39:24.520
Why would she invite Li'er to her mansion

39:24.600 --> 39:26.040
at a time like this?

39:26.520 --> 39:27.920
How did Li'er react?

39:28.000 --> 39:29.640
She said she must go.

39:30.360 --> 39:33.280
She said the Eldest Princess
would not give up easily.

39:33.360 --> 39:35.160
If she doesn't go this time,

39:35.240 --> 39:37.640
the Eldest Princess will find a way
to make her go another day.

39:37.720 --> 39:41.680
She also said if the Eldest Princess
really wants to harm her,

39:41.760 --> 39:45.080
she would not have invited her
with everyone knowing.

39:45.640 --> 39:47.080
Since she has decided to go,

39:47.880 --> 39:49.960
I will just go with her tomorrow.

39:50.040 --> 39:51.600
I don't believe

39:51.680 --> 39:54.400
the Eldest Princess is so unscrupulous

39:54.480 --> 39:57.080
to the point of harming Li'er before me.

40:00.000 --> 40:05.240
PRINCESS WANNING'S MANSION

40:19.880 --> 40:20.760
Li'er,

40:22.640 --> 40:25.800
don't be afraid. I'm here.

40:25.880 --> 40:28.360
I'm sorry to trouble you
to come here with me.

40:34.320 --> 40:35.920
Ms. Jiang Li, this way, please.

40:36.600 --> 40:37.840
Ms. Jiang Li,

40:37.920 --> 40:39.800
Her Highness only invited you.

40:39.880 --> 40:41.400
You asked her to come here,

40:42.080 --> 40:44.440
but you didn't ask her to only come alone.

40:44.520 --> 40:46.400
Chancellor, please don't
give me a hard time.

40:46.480 --> 40:47.640
It's all right, Father.

40:48.320 --> 40:49.640
Just wait for me by the gate.

40:50.200 --> 40:52.280
What can she do to me with you here?

41:53.600 --> 41:57.120
I've long wanted to ask you to teach me
how to play the guqin, Ms. Jiang Li.

41:57.200 --> 41:59.040
Unfortunately, I've been grounded.

41:59.960 --> 42:01.760
Since we have this opportunity today,

42:01.840 --> 42:05.800
why don't you teach me a little?

42:05.880 --> 42:07.800
I'm sure Your Highness didn't invite me

42:07.880 --> 42:09.560
and leave my father outside

42:10.080 --> 42:12.440
to compare notes about the guqin.

42:12.520 --> 42:14.600
Finding a confidant in life is difficult.

42:14.680 --> 42:16.680
I want to see

42:16.760 --> 42:18.280
if I can play in perfect harmony

42:18.360 --> 42:21.840
with you too, Ms. Jiang Li.

42:22.400 --> 42:23.800
Your Highness flatters me.

42:23.880 --> 42:26.000
I'm not worthy
of becoming a confidant of yours.

42:26.080 --> 42:29.480
From Your Highness's music,
I can only hear dominance,

42:30.440 --> 42:32.560
cruelty, heartlessness,

42:33.120 --> 42:35.400
making me feel endless hatred.

42:37.440 --> 42:38.680
I don't think so.

42:41.360 --> 42:42.480
Isn't this the essence

42:42.560 --> 42:44.760
of "Spring Fading
into White Pear Blossoms"?

42:45.680 --> 42:48.000
Didn't you also
play your tune with hatred,

42:48.080 --> 42:50.680
surprising everyone
during the Annual Exam?

42:50.760 --> 42:52.720
Your Highness,
may I know why you have hatred?

42:53.360 --> 42:56.280
As Great Yan's Eldest Princess,
the people provide for you.

42:56.840 --> 42:59.040
You have thousands of yards
of silk as your clothes

42:59.120 --> 43:00.840
and thousands of acres of land
for your food.

43:01.440 --> 43:04.520
Your Highness, isn't it pretentious
for you to be talking about hatred?

43:05.640 --> 43:09.280
Having good clothes and food
provided by the people.

43:12.960 --> 43:14.280
What do you know?

43:14.360 --> 43:17.880
Should I go to Dai alone
for the sake of Great Yan's safety

43:17.960 --> 43:21.160
and live a difficult life
in that extremely cold place?

43:21.240 --> 43:22.080
So?

43:22.680 --> 43:24.200
Just because you live a difficult life,

43:24.280 --> 43:25.720
do other people have to suffer?

43:27.080 --> 43:28.320
I was also murdered

43:29.040 --> 43:30.360
and survived with my hatred,

43:30.920 --> 43:32.960
but I never hurt innocent people

43:33.040 --> 43:34.600
and killed people's wives and clans

43:36.360 --> 43:37.920
because of my selfishness.

43:39.560 --> 43:41.440
It seems like you know many things,

43:41.520 --> 43:42.760
Ms. Jiang Li.

43:42.840 --> 43:45.080
You know so much

43:45.160 --> 43:46.960
and you fell into the hole I dug.

43:47.040 --> 43:49.680
Should I just kill you as well

43:49.760 --> 43:51.160
and destroy all evidence?

43:52.640 --> 43:53.880
You can't kill me.

43:55.200 --> 43:56.360
Are you that confident?

43:57.960 --> 44:01.160
If you kill me,
how can you save Shen Yurong?

44:01.840 --> 44:04.280
Do you know
why I want to save Shen Yurong?

44:04.360 --> 44:07.200
Shen Yurong played up to you
for glory and wealth.

44:07.280 --> 44:09.520
If he knows that you won't save him,

44:09.600 --> 44:11.280
he'll surely drag you down with him.

44:16.000 --> 44:18.240
I'm not afraid of him
dragging me down at all.

44:18.920 --> 44:23.600
The whole Imperial Court
can't pay me what they owe.

44:23.680 --> 44:26.280
The person on the throne now

44:26.360 --> 44:29.040
can't kill me no matter what.

44:29.120 --> 44:31.520
Your Highness, don't you think
you are too arrogant?

44:31.600 --> 44:34.040
I'm just secure in the knowledge
that I have backing.

44:34.120 --> 44:35.840
Shen Yurong is the same.

44:35.920 --> 44:37.560
He's secure
in the knowledge of my backing.

44:42.680 --> 44:43.600
I fancy him.

44:48.320 --> 44:49.440
Your Highness, please stop.

44:49.520 --> 44:50.680
Where is His Majesty?

44:50.760 --> 44:52.680
His Majesty summoned
a few Imperial Exam passers.

44:52.760 --> 44:53.680
I'm afraid he's busy.

44:54.520 --> 44:55.360
Fine.

45:17.600 --> 45:18.440
Who is that man?

45:18.920 --> 45:21.440
He is this year's top scorer, Shen Yurong.

45:21.520 --> 45:23.320
His Majesty appointed him
as a Hanlin Academy scholar

45:23.400 --> 45:24.960
to be in charge of book compilation.

45:40.440 --> 45:41.560
Mr. Shen,

45:42.920 --> 45:46.920
why did you keep my handkerchief?

45:47.680 --> 45:50.400
He was an interesting man back then.

45:51.680 --> 45:55.320
Everyone avoided me
or despised me in secret,

45:56.240 --> 45:59.320
but he treated me fairly and politely.

46:05.720 --> 46:07.680
Eldest Princess, please keep it well.

46:08.240 --> 46:09.720
Since you picked up my handkerchief,

46:10.360 --> 46:13.760
does it mean
that there's some kind of fate

46:14.480 --> 46:15.880
between us?

46:17.600 --> 46:19.040
I am married.

46:19.120 --> 46:20.560
I don't dare to do that.

46:29.480 --> 46:32.000
Back then, he only wanted
to become a good official.

46:32.560 --> 46:33.800
He was pure and innocent,

46:34.840 --> 46:37.320
which was very different from me.

46:38.400 --> 46:39.760
He was too clean,

46:40.320 --> 46:42.720
to the point that I could imagine

46:43.360 --> 46:44.720
the kind of pure woman

46:44.800 --> 46:47.000
who stands beside him.

46:48.920 --> 46:52.120
I thought if I wasn't sent to Dai,

46:53.400 --> 46:55.760
I might also marry a good man

46:55.840 --> 46:58.720
and live a normal life like you.

47:01.000 --> 47:03.120
I think there's no difference
between you two and me.

47:04.160 --> 47:07.000
If someone like me
can't have such happiness,

47:07.080 --> 47:09.200
why do you deserve it?

47:10.480 --> 47:11.800
I hated how unfair fate was to me.

47:13.160 --> 47:15.480
I wanted to drag Shen Yurong
down into the quagmire,

47:16.120 --> 47:19.280
so we could be together.

47:21.360 --> 47:22.560
Is there still a point to this?

47:23.680 --> 47:25.120
Is the murderer Shen Yurong

47:25.600 --> 47:28.560
still the same as the young man
who cherished your handkerchief?

47:28.640 --> 47:30.480
As long as he is with me

47:30.960 --> 47:33.520
- and you…
- I've long stopped caring about him.

47:34.880 --> 47:37.480
Both of you committed so many atrocities.

47:38.360 --> 47:39.840
Now, you got your karma.

47:41.800 --> 47:44.240
Wanning, you can't save him.

47:44.880 --> 47:46.480
You also can't live the life you want.

47:50.280 --> 47:51.640
Who says I can't save him?

47:54.280 --> 47:56.240
Do you want to bribe everyone
to change their testimonies?

47:57.160 --> 47:58.360
I don't believe

47:58.440 --> 48:00.240
you have control over the entire nation.

48:00.840 --> 48:03.160
I'm not that capable indeed.

48:04.000 --> 48:06.640
Saving Shen Yurong
doesn't require that many people either.

48:07.680 --> 48:09.840
I just need one person
to change her testimony.

48:16.200 --> 48:20.960
Won't the matter be settled
if you tell the Court of Judicial Review

48:21.040 --> 48:24.840
that it was a misunderstanding
and you falsely accused Shen Yurong?

48:30.360 --> 48:31.440
All right.

48:32.280 --> 48:34.480
I'll say that when the time comes,

48:35.280 --> 48:36.600
as you wish.

48:36.680 --> 48:37.640
Farewell.

48:41.120 --> 48:42.880
My father is still waiting
for me at the gate.

48:43.440 --> 48:46.000
What's the rush? You are already here.

48:46.760 --> 48:48.040
Let me take you to see someone,

48:49.360 --> 48:51.960
someone you know very well.
